# Hands: grab to use a door. A grip with the palm at a door's use spot takes hold of it; drawing the hand 12 cm away pulls it,
# and that uses the door (a slide door opens or closes). Letting go of the grip without drawing the hand does not.
# World: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity). A slide door is built 1.7 m ahead (a large block, 2.5 m). The door
# itself is not read here: the plugin's own report is the check. The palm
# position is a first guess: tune it from the "Grab use: right palm N cm from" lines in the log.

plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- What the world needs: a slide door in front of the character --------------------------------------------------------------

admin creativeTools
# out of the starter base, where nothing is built within 10 m, to build there
goto open
build LargeBlockSlideDoor 3 as Test door
# the door's use box is the doorway's middle, about the closed door: standing in the doorway, 1.2 m from the block's
# middle, its near side is 37 cm ahead, under the hand
goto Test door 1.2
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
hand left -0.25 1.0 -0.2
hand right 0.1 1.25 -0.45
wait 1
expect no log Grab use: right hand took hold

# ---- Grip, then let go with the hand where it is: held, but not pulled -> not used -----------------------------------------------

press right grip
wait 1
expect log Grab use: right hand took hold of within 5
release right grip
wait 1
expect no log Grab use: right hand used

# ---- Grip again and draw the hand back 20 cm: the pull -> used -------------------------------------------------------------------

press right grip
wait 1
hand right 0.1 1.25 -0.25
wait 1
expect log Grab use: right hand used within 5
release right grip
wait 1
expect no log Exception
